242
00:32:51.386 --> 00:32:53.721
<i>Of course. all the staff are included.</i>

243
00:32:53.805 --> 00:32:55.264
<i>You want to sell it?</i>

244
00:32:55.348 --> 00:32:57.976
<i>I suggest we be more mature.</i>

245
00:32:58.059 --> 00:32:59.310
<i>We must face reality.</i>

246
00:32:59.394 --> 00:33:00.603
<i>What do you think?</i>

247
00:33:01.771 --> 00:33:02.730
<i>Guys.</i>

248
