250
00:33:09.612 --> 00:33:11.364
<i>You all must remember the day</i>

251
00:33:12.865 --> 00:33:14.367
<i>the original model was completed.</i>

252
00:33:16.953 --> 00:33:19.455
<i>From the start. our research intention</i>

253
00:33:20.331 --> 00:33:23.626
<i>was to play a role</i>
<i>in healthcare and education.</i>

254
00:33:24.669 --> 00:33:28.631
<i>not simply catering to the VR games</i>
<i>the media keeps talking about.</i>

255
00:33:30.633 --> 00:33:32.343
<i>We put so much effort into this.</i>

256
00:33:35.555 --> 00:33:37.640
<i>To collect beach sample data.</i>

257
00:33:39.308 --> 00:33:41.102
<i>I even sacrificed my legs.</i>

258
00:33:49.235 --> 00:33:50.737
-Li Qiang.
-So.

259
00:33:51.571 --> 00:33:53.322
Shenqi isn't going anywhere.

260
00:33:54.615 --> 00:33:55.616
Trust me.

261
00:33:56.743 --> 00:33:57.744
I have a way.

262
00:34:04.042 --> 00:34:05.251
Come on.

263
00:34:05.334 --> 00:34:06.544
Let's get to work.

264
00:34:08.796 --> 00:34:10.590
Dr. Li. I support you.

265
00:34:16.763 --> 00:34:19.432
<i>As the originator.</i>
<i>it's your right to keep it.</i>

266
00:34:21.100 --> 00:34:24.645
<i>But you can't let everyone</i>
<i>starve with you for your ideals.</i>

267
00:34:25.938 --> 00:34:28.941
<i>Over half of the team agrees</i>
<i>to the acquisition.</i>

268
00:34:31.152 --> 00:34:32.320
<i>Think about it more.</i>

269
00:34:39.035 --> 00:34:40.787
TEXTSTAY

